      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chef Barinov announces to the entire restaurant that he is retiring from the stove and handing the title of head chef to his best friend and sous-chef, Lyova. Yet Lyova declines the promotion of a lifetime to fly to Bishkek after Gulya.",
      "gap": 0.8
